        {
            "title": "Honoring a Legacy, Helping Our Veterans",
            "slug": "veteran-legacy",
            "content": "<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>At the Kevin Popke Foundation, we are a dedicated team of volunteers united by a single purpose: turning our convictions into action to help others.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Our foundation was established to honor the life, ideals, and values of our namesake, Donald \u201cKevin\u201d Popke, who was tragically killed by a distracted driver in 2016. Known affectionately as \u201c50\u201d to his friends, Kevin dedicated his entire adult life to serving our country. He retired as a US Army First Sergeant and continued his service as a Department of Defense contractor. We created this foundation to ensure that Kevin's spirit of service and dedication to his fellow service members lives on.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">What We Do</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Our mission is simple: <em>Helping our Veterans.</em></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>We recognize the immense sacrifices made by the men and women who have defended our Nation, and we are committed to giving back to them. The Kevin Popke Foundation supports Veteran-focused charities in the Tampa Bay area and throughout other cities in Florida. By providing targeted grants, we help fund the vital resources and support systems necessary to meet the needs of our local Veterans.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">What you can do</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Show up for a Saturday event, share a story from the community, or point us toward an organization that deserves a closer look. Small actions keep Kevin\u2019s mission moving.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">How to help</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Volunteer with the team, nominate a Veteran-focused charity for a grant, or give \u2014 every gift becomes support in Kevin\u2019s name.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Together We Can</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>We believe that when we come together, we can make a profound difference in the lives of those who have served. Whether you are interested in joining our amazing team of volunteers or supporting our mission through a donation, your contribution helps us improve conditions for Veterans and keep Kevin\u2019s legacy alive.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>To learn more about our upcoming events, get in touch, or find out how you can help, please explore our website. Together, we can.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n",
            "excerpt": "",
            "date": "2026-07-19 22:26:06",
            "thumbnail_id": 301
        }
    ]
